OL,3,CMeghan calls Harry 'a charmer' after
OL,4,Csurprise MasterChef video call
OL,6,FThe Duchess of Sussex described her
OL,7,Fhusband as a "charmer" after he made a
OL,8,Fsurprise video call during her
OL,9,Fappearance on MasterChef Australia.
OL,11,FMeghan was a guest judge on the 18th
OL,12,Fseason of the cooking show on Sunday,
OL,13,Fwhere contestants were challenged to
OL,14,Ftransform a larder ingredient into a
OL,15,Fdish "fit for a duchess".
OL,17,FThe couple spoke during the show's
OL,18,Fjudging portion, when Harry called to
OL,19,Fcheck in.
OL,26,@oD@NOUoD@VO]wD@FOUwD@XO]
