PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1785154708
OL,3,CMeghan calls Harry 'a charmer' after
OL,4,Csurprise MasterChef video call
OL,6,F"Hi, my love," she said after
OL,7,Fproducers handed her the phone,
OL,8,Fintroducing Harry to contestants and
OL,9,Fjudges and showing him the dishes.
OL,11,F"My husband's here," she told the
OL,12,Fstunned crowd.
OL,14,FThe episode was filmed during Meghan
OL,15,Fand Prince Harry's week-long trip to
OL,16,FAustralia in April.
OL,18,FThe duke and his wife carried out
OL,19,Fcharitable and commercial engagements
OL,20,Facross Melbourne, Canberra and Sydney.
OL,26,@nD@AOUnD@NO]sD@AOUsD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
