PN,31203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1785154708
OL,3,CMeghan calls Harry 'a charmer' after
OL,4,Csurprise MasterChef video call
OL,6,FThe duchess praised contestant Aaron
OL,7,FKher's dish but joked it packed "too
OL,8,Fmuch" spice for Harry, who greeted the
OL,9,FAustralian group with a "G'Day".
OL,11,F"He's a charmer, isn't he?" she said
OL,12,Fafter the phone call ended.
OL,14,FAsked about cooking for her family,
OL,15,Fthe Meghan said she had "a lot of
OL,16,Fpalates to appease", and that her
OL,17,Fchildren Prince Archie and Princess
OL,18,FLilibet "are great eaters" who enjoy
OL,19,FBrussels sprouts.
OL,26,@oD@aOUpD@EO]qD@YOUqD@_O]sD@AOUsD@[O]wD@
OL,26,AYOUxD@SO]zD@IOUzD@ZO]
