OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1785154708
OL,3,CMeghan calls Harry 'a charmer' after
OL,4,Csurprise MasterChef video call
OL,6,F"The kids jump in a lot, especially in
OL,7,Fthe garden," she said, describing how
OL,8,Fthe family often prepares food
OL,9,Ftogether.
OL,11,FMeghan added: "Family time, I think,
OL,12,Fis really key to connect through food,
OL,13,Fso as many meals as we can do
OL,14,Ftogether, we always do."
OL,16,FShe said her husband's British
OL,17,Fupbringing meant he preferred "meat,
OL,18,Fpotatoes and cream sauce" while the
OL,19,FCalifornian-born duchess favoured
OL,20,Fgrilled meats, fish and citrus.
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@LO]sD@OOUvD@XO]yD@_OUzD@YO]
