OL,3,CMeghan calls Harry 'a charmer' after
OL,4,Csurprise MasterChef video call
OL,6,FA previous announcement from the
OL,7,FSussexes described the new season as
OL,8,Ffeaturing some of the "most impressive
OL,9,Famateur cooks the competition has ever
OL,10,Fseen".
OL,12,FTheir Australian visit included
OL,13,Fmeetings with mental health charities,
OL,14,FInvictus veterans and survivors and
OL,15,Femergency service personnel from the
OL,16,FBondi Beach terror attack.
OL,18,F"We love Australia. We had the most
OL,19,Fsentimental, amazing time. We were
OL,20,Fhere almost eight years ago," the
OL,21,Fduchess said of her visit.
OL,26,@pD@WOUrD@EO]zD@AOU|D@]O]
